OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787078900
OL,3,CMark Hughes' son died from sudden
OL,4,Cadult death syndrome
OL,6,FThe son of Manchester United and Wales
OL,7,Ffootballer Mark Hughes died from
OL,8,F"sudden adult death syndrome," an
OL,9,Finquest has found.
OL,11,FAlex Hughes, 38, was found collapsed
OL,12,Fat home in his bedroom in
OL,13,FMacclesfield, Cheshire on 19 June by
OL,14,Fhis sons and his death was confirmed
OL,15,Fby paramedics.
OL,17,FHughes was Grimsby Town's player
OL,18,Frecruitment lead, and previously held
OL,19,Froles at clubs including Manchester
OL,20,FCity, Fulham, Blackburn, and 1860
OL,21,FMunich.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
