PN,36802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787078900
OL,3,CMark Hughes' son died from sudden
OL,4,Cadult death syndrome
OL,6,FFollowing a post-mortem examination,
OL,7,Fhis death was linked to "sudden adult
OL,8,Fdeath syndrome," also known as Sudden
OL,9,FArrhythmic Death Syndrome (SADS).
OL,11,FSADS is diagnosed when the cause of
OL,12,Fdeath cannot be explained in a post-
OL,13,Fmortem exam because the structure of
OL,14,Fthe heart appears normal.
OL,16,FIt affects around 500 people in the UK
OL,17,Fevery year and the British Heart
OL,18,FFoundation said SADS "usually happens
OL,19,Fwhen a dangerously abnormal heart
OL,20,Frhythm goes untreated and leads to
OL,21,Fcardiac arrest."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,369,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787078901
OL,3,CMark Hughes' son died from sudden
OL,4,Cadult death syndrome
OL,6,FThe foundation added that inherited
OL,7,Fheart conditions are "often the cause
OL,8,Fof SADS if the person who has it
OL,9,Fdoesn't know they do."
OL,11,FFormer striker Mark Hughes said he and
OL,12,Fhis family were "heartbroken"
OL,13,Ffollowing the sudden death of his son.
OL,15,FIn a statement released through the
OL,16,FLeague Managers Association, the
OL,17,Fformer Manchester City, Stoke, and
OL,18,FBlackburn boss said: "Jill and I are
OL,19,Ftotally heartbroken by the sudden and
OL,20,Funexpected loss of our beloved son
OL,21,FAlex.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
