PN,36804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787078901
OL,3,CMark Hughes' son died from sudden
OL,4,Cadult death syndrome
OL,6,F"Alex was a wonderful son, brother to
OL,7,FCurtis and Xenna, devoted husband and
OL,8,Ffather to Jessica and their two
OL,9,Fbeautiful children Sebastian and
OL,10,FLeonardo.
OL,12,F"Alex was player recruitment lead at
OL,13,FGrimsby Town FC, and had many good
OL,14,Ffriends and colleagues. He will be so
OL,15,Fdeeply missed by us all."
OL,17,FAlex Hughes had a brief playing
OL,18,Fcareer, on the books of Stockport and
OL,19,FWrexham, before joining Blackburn in
OL,20,F2007, working as a performance analyst
OL,21,Fduring his father's time as manager.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
