OL,3,CMark Hughes' son died from sudden
OL,4,Cadult death syndrome
OL,6,FHe followed Mark to Manchester City in
OL,7,F2008 and worked with him again at
OL,8,FFulham before forging his own path
OL,9,Fabroad. He joined Grimsby in 2025.
